      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "2014 BMJ Publishing Group Ltd.",
        "AbstractText": "We present a rare case of reverse intestinal rotation with volvulus around a Meckel's diverticulum attached to a vitelline duct remnant. The diagnosis was established by CT. The patient was treated with exploratory laparotomy and small bowel resection. The patient made a full recovery and was discharged home on the seventh postoperative day."
